From 4682b0b0535d5a2f16b8ed55634ad7b3a7b26dd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:47:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): join image and owned path traversal

Resolve owned links into readonly image paths and registered image-directory
relative operations through the existing component walker. Preserve task cwd,
script names and native syscall restoration while canonicalizing only private
script execution copies. Keep device absence and assignment precedence.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
